	"nodes":[
		{"id":"1a2b3c4d5e6f7081","type":"text","text":"# Datenmodell — Pricing-DB (Kapitel 1.2)\n\nAlle Beziehungen **1:n** über Foreign Keys · **natürliche** Schlüssel (products, customers) · **Surrogat**-Schlüssel (capacity, bookings, prices, price_recommendations)\n\nLegende: 🔑 Primärschlüssel · 🔗 Fremdschlüssel · ⧉ UNIQUE · ✓ CHECK · ∑ GENERATED · ⚡ Index — Details: [[Datenmodell]]","x":-40,"y":-470,"width":1400,"height":130},
		{"id":"0a1b2c3d4e5f6075","type":"text","text":"# prices\n🔑 **id** (PK, Surrogat)\nsource_id  *(Hex)*\n🔗 product_id → products\nchange_date\ncurrent_price  ✓ ≥ 0\nlength_of_stay  *(TEXT — enthält 'XN')*\n⚡ product_id","x":720,"y":1120,"width":380,"height":240,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"0a1b2c3d4e5f6074","type":"text","text":"# bookings\n🔑 **id** (PK, Surrogat)\nsource_id  *(Quell-id, nicht eindeutig)*\nbkg_id\n🔗 product_id → products\n🔗 cust_id → customers\nstart_date\nbooking_creation_date\nstatus  ✓ IN (Firm/Cancelled/Expired/Pending)\ncancellation_date\ngross_revenue\ndiscount_amount\nnet_revenue   gross − discount\nbase_currency  *(DEFAULT 'STG')*\nnights  ✓ ≥ 1\nfeature_2\n⚡ product_id · ⚡ cust_id · *(kein Index auf status)*","x":720,"y":445,"width":380,"height":520,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"0a1b2c3d4e5f6073","type":"text","text":"# capacity\n🔑 **id** (PK, Surrogat)\n🔗 product_id → products\ncalendar_date\nbookable_units  *(kann negativ, kein ✓)*\noptional_units\n⧉ UNIQUE (product_id, calendar_date)\n⚡ calendar_date\n\n*→ CapacityRow / PriceableUnit*","x":720,"y":20,"width":380,"height":300,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"0a1b2c3d4e5f6076","type":"text","text":"# price_recommendations\n🔑 **id** (PK, Surrogat)\n🔗 capacity_id → capacity\ncomputed_at\nreference_date\ndays_until_travel\nrecommended_adjustment_pct\noccupancy\ntotal_capacity\nbooked_units\n⚡ capacity_id · ⚡ reference_date\n\n*→ PriceRecommendation (Output)*","x":1600,"y":20,"width":380,"height":375,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"0a1b2c3d4e5f6072","type":"text","text":"# customers\n🔑 **cust_id** (PK, natürlich)\n*attributlos — Wachstums-Wette*","x":-240,"y":990,"width":340,"height":130,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"0a1b2c3d4e5f6071","type":"text","text":"# products\n🔑 **product_id** (PK, natürlich)\nbedroom_type  *(aus feature_1, NF3)*","x":-240,"y":245,"width":340,"height":150,"color":"4"}
